      "content": "it's just exhausting. every time i try to look forward, i just see this wall of nothing. i'm not even angry anymore, i'm just tired. like, i've done my part, i stood up for the truth, and this is the reward. it feels like i've reached the end of the road. i keep thinking... if the world is this corrupt and people are this cruel, why am i even fighting to stay in it? it doesn't feel like i'm fighting for anything anymore.",
